    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278532</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>くっ……！
一体、ヤツはどこへ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dammit...! Where the
hell did he go...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278788</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ご報告します！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Reporting!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278788</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_021&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;ユークリッド&lt;White&gt;及び&lt;Red&gt;トーティス&lt;White&gt;、
その他、多くの街が
魔物に襲撃されています！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Red&gt;Euclid&lt;White&gt;, &lt;Red&gt;Totus&lt;White&gt;, and countless
other towns are now under
attack by monsters!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278788</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうやら、その魔物たちは
&lt;Red&gt;スルト深林&lt;White&gt;から来ていると
思われます！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The details are unknown, but it is
suspected that those monsters have
come from the &lt;Red&gt;Surt Deepwoods&lt;White&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278940</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;スルト深林&lt;White&gt;だと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The &lt;Red&gt;Surt Deepwoods&lt;White&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278940</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>確かあの森には、
無害な獣しか住んで
いなかったはずでは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that forest should
only be inhabited by
weak, harmless monsters...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279088</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まさか、魔界の扉……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then that means...
The Otherworldy
Gate really...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279088</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あの森の深くに
魔界と人間界をつなぐ
扉があると言います！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's said that the gate which
connects the human world to
Daemonium lies deep in that forest!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279248</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>封印が解かれた……
魔界の民を操る……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The seal has been lifted...
Controlling daemons...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279248</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_028&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ブレイナーが
言っていたのは
このことなのか！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...So this is what
Brynhildr was
talking about!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279376</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_029&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>このままでは、
&lt;Red&gt;トーティス&lt;White&gt;や&lt;Red&gt;ユークリッド&lt;White&gt;で
多くの犠牲者が出ます！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>At this rate, there will
be countless victims in
both &lt;Red&gt;Totus&lt;White&gt; and &lt;Red&gt;Euclid&lt;White&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279488</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>全軍を各方面に回せ！
魔物の排除と、
住民の保護を最優先だ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>All troops, patrol *every* region!
Our top priorities are to exterminate
the monsters and protect the citizens!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279700</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_032&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Cless&gt;さん……わたしたちは
&lt;Red&gt;スルト深林&lt;White&gt;へ行った方が
いいのではないでしょうか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Cless&gt;... Shouldn't we go
to the &lt;Red&gt;Surt Deepwoods&lt;White&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279792</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_033&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうか……ブレイナーを
捕まえないと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You might be right... We
have to catch Brynhildr...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279920</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_034&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ええ、それに扉を閉じなければ、
多くの魔物たちがこちらの
世界へ流れ出てきます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right, and if we don't close the
door, monsters will continue
to pour into our world...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280036</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_035&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、村は彼らに任せて、
僕たちは魔物を
抑えに行った方がいいね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then we should leave the villages
to them and go ourselves to stop
the monsters at the source.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280136</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_036&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はい。それでは
&lt;Red&gt;12星座の塔&lt;White&gt;へ行きましょう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes. Then, we should go to
the &lt;Red&gt;Tower of the Zodiac&lt;White&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_037&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>12星座の……
ルナのところに……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Tower of the...
To where Luna is...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280344</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_038&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔界の扉はルナの光で
封印されていたはずです。
彼女の力を借りなければ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Otherworldy Gate should
be sealed by the light of
Luna. We'll need her powers.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280516</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_039&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Got it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280516</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_040&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>僕たちは、これから
&lt;Red&gt;12星座の塔&lt;White&gt;へ行く。
君たちとはここでお別れだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>From here, we're going to the
&lt;Red&gt;Tower of the Zodiac&lt;White&gt;. We'll have
to part ways with you here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280516</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_041&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>急ごう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's hurry!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280604</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_042&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたし、行くよ、
いいでしょ？　エト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Can we go,
too? Ethos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280688</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_043&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>きみたちは
虹輪を消さなきゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You two need to
stop the Prism Ring!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280864</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_044&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、今、この世界は
大変なことになってるんだよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But the world's in really big
trouble right now, isn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280864</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_045&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それを目の前で
放っておくなんて、わたし……
できないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now that I've seen
how bad things are
here, I can't just...leave.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280960</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_046&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>行こうぜ……！
&lt;Cless&gt;さんたちの後を追おう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's go...! We gotta catch
up to &lt;Cless&gt; and &lt;Mint&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281040</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_047&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Dio&gt;、
もう平気なの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You're feeling
okay now, &lt;Dio&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281120</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_048&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ……
確かめなきゃ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah... I gotta
make sure...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281192</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_049&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうしたの、&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What happened, &lt;Dio&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281284</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_050&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんでもない……
&lt;Red&gt;12星座の塔&lt;White&gt;に行こう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nothin'... Let's go, to
the &lt;Red&gt;Tower of the Zodiac&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281348</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_051&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルルー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleureuu!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>281416</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_140_050_052&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……確かめなきゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I gotta
make sure...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
